 energy requirement is **12.5 kWh per day**. It is important to note that this figure is not an externally verified measurement but rather an illustrative assumption derived from model knowledge and standard energy calculation practices.\\n\\nThe calculation considers factors such as power consumption, operational duration, system efficiency, environmental conditions, and load variations. These assumptions are used to estimate energy requirements for illustrative purposes, ensuring that the calculation reflects real-world operational conditions.\\n\\nIn terms of energy generation and storage systems, several engineering tradeoffs must be considered, including system efficiency, reliability, maintenance requirements, energy source compatibility, storage capacity versus weight and space, scalability, and environmental impact. These tradeoffs are critical for selecting and implementing an appropriate energy system for a remote research station.", "correlationId": "330e4756-05b9-4af0-aa3c-037aaa7577df", "failureReason": null, "planCorrections": 0, "consumedRequests": 5, "executionAuthorized": true, "consumedOutputTokens": 1104, "submitterPrincipalId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "estimatedOutputTokens": 0, "estimatedCostUsdMicros": null}	{}
