COPY public.permissions (name, description) FROM stdin;
agent:create	Register an agent in an active department
agent:update	Update mutable agent profile fields or attach a lifecycle executor
agent:start	Initialize, resume, or start an agent lifecycle
agent:stop	Pause, yield, stop, or report failure for an agent
agent:archive	Archive an agent
agent:assign-role	Assign an agent role. Does not include self-assignment
department:create	Propose a department
department:update	Update department profile fields, pause, deprecate, or fail a department
department:activate	Resume a paused department
department:archive	Archive a department
model:register	Register model metadata or a new immutable model version
budget:request	Request a budget change
budget:approve	Approve a budget change for a target the actor does not belong to
audit:read	Read append-only audit events
approval:request	Open an approval request
approval:decide	Decide temporary department approvals
approval:decide:permanent	Decide permanent department creation and activation
message:publish	Send an IACP message as the authenticated agent
message:read	Read messages the actor sent or is allowed to receive
message:consume	Pull the authenticated agent's inbox
message:acknowledge	Acknowledge or reject a delivered message addressed to the actor
message:dead_letter:read	Inspect dead letters the actor is allowed to see
message:dead_letter:redrive	Republish a dead-lettered message through the outbox
message:admin	Read messaging records and metrics across the colony
objective:submit	Submit an objective for CEO planning
objective:read	Read objectives submitted by this principal
objective:admin	Read every objective
objective:execute	Authorize ordinary objective execution after a valid plan
objective:cancel	Cancel an objective
inference:read	Read model runtime health and inference usage
monitoring:read	Read operational monitoring overview
memory:create	Create a memory in a scope this principal owns
memory:read:own	Read memory owned by this agent
memory:read:department	Read memory shared inside this agent's department
memory:read:colony	Read colony-wide memory
memory:search	Search memories the actor is allowed to read
memory:update:own	Revise a memory this agent owns
memory:archive	Archive a memory the actor is allowed to change
memory:promote:propose	Propose moving a memory to a wider scope
memory:promote:approve	Approve a memory promotion. Colony publication stays with the administrator
memory:consolidate	Merge duplicate memories while keeping the originals
memory:admin	Read and administer memory in every scope
training:dataset:create	Prepare a sealed training dataset from eligible sources
training:dataset:read	Read dataset versions, splits, and example provenance
training:propose	Propose a training run or recommend candidate promotion
training:approve	Approve a training run. Agents cannot approve their own proposal
training:execute	Launch an approved run on the allowlisted trainer
training:cancel	Cancel a queued or running training job
training:read	Read training runs, metrics, artifacts, and worker health
training:evaluate	Score a candidate against its frozen baseline
model:candidate:read	Read candidate adapters and evaluation reports
model:candidate:promote	Approve a candidate for experimental inference only
model:experimental:infer	Run inference on an approved candidate without using production routing
evaluation:suite:create	Propose a benchmark suite version
evaluation:suite:approve	Publish an immutable benchmark version
evaluation:run	Execute an evaluation, including sealed items
evaluation:read	Read evaluation reports without sealed prompts
evaluation:gate:decide	Record a pass, fail, inconclusive, or quarantine gate
evaluation:candidate:quarantine	Quarantine a candidate without deleting its history
model:rollback:request	Request an experimental route rollback
model:rollback:approve	Approve an experimental route rollback
model:rollback:execute	Apply an approved experimental route change
memory:retention:manage	Publish a retention policy and preview its matches
memory:forget:request	Request controlled forgetting and an impact report
memory:forget:approve	Approve a forgetting request
memory:forget:execute	Erase live memory content after approval
learning:observe	Record an observable capability gap
learning:propose	Propose a learning objective or training experiment
learning:read	Read learning cycles, gaps, and outcomes
learning:approve	Approve adoption of a gated capability
learning:transfer	Send a knowledge package to another department
learning:validate	Accept or reject a knowledge package for this department
capability:approve	Approve a department capability version from evidence
\.
